There is a knock on my door.
It is Nina, my neighbour.
"Good morning Maya, how are you?" she asks.
"I am fine, thank you," I answer.
"It is my first day at work today."
Nina is very warm and smiles.
"Good luck!" she says.
"Is the office far away?" I ask.
"No, it is not far," she answers.
"You can take bus number four," she says.
I say thank you for the help.
